{"unit_id":"SmailPang__dsh-effort-slider#feature-1","repo":"SmailPang/dsh-effort-slider","commit":"239cddbc3a75fbc883d9b3c350c53a452c947caa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-effort-slider 的功能「推理强度滑块」：在模型座位的推理等级面板拖动滑块选择 Off、Low、High 或 Max；松手后通过 DSH 原生选项应用选择，并让面板保持打开。","source":"generated","evidence":["web/widget.js:977-1018"]}
