{"unit_id":"SmailPang__dsh-effort-slider#feature-4","repo":"SmailPang/dsh-effort-slider","commit":"239cddbc3a75fbc883d9b3c350c53a452c947caa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-effort-slider 的功能「识别推理等级面板」：监听页面菜单变化，找到模型座位的推理等级面板后挂载滑块，并在 DOM 更新时重新协调界面。","source":"generated","evidence":["web/widget.js:1260-1274"]}
